- **Rendering and timing:** I re-ran headless Chromium at device pixel ratios 1 and 2. Both gave about 35 tics/s and 70 presents/s, with 0 non-opaque pixels and 178 distinct colours. The canvas stayed 640x400, and there were no page errors.
- **Canvas scaling:** at ratio 1 a 1920x1080 window displays at 1728x1080 and a 1000x700 window at 1000x625. At ratio 2 they come out as 1600x1000 and 960x600. These match the previous round.
